# Copy to .env and fill in ONE OR MORE of these to enable the natural-
# language search bar (see llm_providers.py). With none set, search still
# works via plain keyword matching instead. With more than one set, the
# search bar's "Auto" option tries each configured provider in turn until
# one works, so a single provider's outage doesn't take the feature down.
#
# Gemini, Groq, and Mistral all have a genuine standing free tier (rate-
# limited, not a one-time trial credit). Anthropic and OpenAI don't, only
# a one-time trial credit, then pay-as-you-go.

# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional: force a specific provider instead of "auto" trying each
# configured one in turn. One of: gemini, groq, mistral, anthropic, openai
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
